<title>TRINIDAD AND TOBAGO: CRICKET-WEST INDIES 121 ALL OUT V INDIA.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-WEST INDIES 121 ALL OUT V INDIA.</headline>
<dateline>PORT OF SPAIN, Trinidad 1997-04-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>West Indies were 121 all out against India in the second one-day international at Queen's Park Oval on Sunday.</p>
